1
00:01:48,470 --> 00:01:52,509
[A Good Day to Ascend]

2
00:01:54,810 --> 00:01:57,830
[Episode 3: Nuo Arts]

3
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:09,039
You lowly ant,

4
00:02:09,919 --> 00:02:11,560
you should feel honored.

5
00:02:12,440 --> 00:02:14,160
Today, you'll witness

6
00:02:14,600 --> 00:02:16,960
something you've never seen in your life—

7
00:02:17,440 --> 00:02:19,800
the orthodox Nuo arts.

8
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:24,440
Heavenly soul births the White Tiger.

9
00:02:24,880 --> 00:02:29,040
Earthly spirit gives rise
to the Azure Dragon.

10
00:02:36,240 --> 00:02:39,429
Preserve the upper elixir field,

11
00:02:39,430 --> 00:02:42,990
to seize the immortal's panacea.

12
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:46,600
Xu Ying!

13
00:02:46,840 --> 00:02:48,039
No matter how strong you are,

14
00:02:48,040 --> 00:02:50,600
can you overpower this endless Vine Arts?

15
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:53,489
Don't think that just because you've
picked up some lowly demonic techniques,

16
00:02:53,490 --> 00:02:55,530
you can challenge the Nuo arts.

17
00:02:58,400 --> 00:03:00,080
Vine Arts!

18
00:03:05,040 --> 00:03:08,600
Who's the loser now?

19
00:03:26,840 --> 00:03:27,640
Strangle!

20
00:03:42,860 --> 00:03:45,460
You're overconfident.

21
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:48,639
Once entangled by these vines, he's dead.

22
00:03:48,640 --> 00:03:50,880
Should I save him or not?

23
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:54,140
We barely know each other.

24
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:58,560
Don't worry.

25
00:03:59,079 --> 00:04:00,880
I will spare your life.

26
00:04:01,720 --> 00:04:02,520
After all,

27
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:04,880
the Zhou family wants you alive.

28
00:04:07,550 --> 00:04:10,150
But the rest of your parts?

29
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:15,680
No need for them.

30
00:04:18,320 --> 00:04:19,139
What?

31
00:04:19,140 --> 00:04:19,940
Fire...

32
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:23,440
You're still alive?

33
00:04:27,840 --> 00:04:29,400
Thanks for the reminder.

34
00:04:30,320 --> 00:04:31,239
No matter how strong you are,

35
00:04:31,240 --> 00:04:33,800
can you overpower this endless Vine Arts?

36
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:35,360
Vine Arts.

37
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:37,080
Fire

38
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:38,920
counters wood.

39
00:04:39,640 --> 00:04:41,110
[Burning wood with fire]

40
00:04:43,600 --> 00:04:45,730
[Great Sun Guiding Technique]
[Elephant Force Bull Fist]

41
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:46,380
Great Sun Body-Refining.

42
00:04:53,260 --> 00:04:55,300
A flash of insight mid-battle,

43
00:04:55,630 --> 00:04:58,080
and you break my Nuo technique.

44
00:04:59,640 --> 00:05:01,519
If it had been the Zhou family's
true Nuo technique,

45
00:05:01,520 --> 00:05:03,850
I probably wouldn't have broken through.

46
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:05,960
Looks like even as their dog,

47
00:05:06,330 --> 00:05:09,450
the Zhou family never taught you
their true Nuo arts.

48
00:05:10,190 --> 00:05:11,019
Shut up!

49
00:05:11,020 --> 00:05:12,180
Ant Xu Ying!

50
00:05:15,780 --> 00:05:16,900
My turn now!

51
00:05:33,280 --> 00:05:34,680
You could have been a man,

52
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:36,330
but you chose to be a dog.

53
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:43,720
So fast.

54
00:05:45,680 --> 00:05:46,600
You slave!

55
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:48,759
All your so-called efforts

56
00:05:48,760 --> 00:05:49,839
are just relying on others' power

57
00:05:49,840 --> 00:05:50,800
to bully the weak

58
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:54,199
and doing the Zhou family's dirty work!

59
00:05:54,200 --> 00:05:55,600
I'll kill you!

60
00:05:55,760 --> 00:05:57,840
Go to hell!

61
00:05:58,760 --> 00:06:00,079
You're just a commoner!

62
00:06:00,080 --> 00:06:02,640
A little power and you put on airs!

63
00:06:03,150 --> 00:06:04,480
You asked for a beating!

64
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:17,400
Entangle!

65
00:06:22,440 --> 00:06:24,080
Great Prison Lotus!

66
00:06:33,110 --> 00:06:34,210
[Elephant Force Bull Fist]

67
00:06:39,760 --> 00:06:40,440
What...

68
00:06:46,250 --> 00:06:47,730
You monster!

69
00:06:51,670 --> 00:06:53,870
Elephant Force Bull Fist, fourth form!

70
00:06:54,550 --> 00:06:55,790
Bad luck, begone!

71
00:06:56,230 --> 00:06:57,470
Begone!

72
00:06:59,850 --> 00:07:03,050
I need to leave this place
and head into the woods quickly.

73
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:08,280
Keep chasing.

74
00:07:08,680 --> 00:07:10,440
You'll regret it soon enough.

75
00:07:10,840 --> 00:07:13,880
One solid punch—
that's all it takes to end this.

76
00:07:22,070 --> 00:07:22,640
Oh no.

77
00:07:23,180 --> 00:07:24,580
Such powerful pressure.

78
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:25,720
I can't move.

79
00:07:29,510 --> 00:07:31,430
Go to hell!

80
00:07:36,920 --> 00:07:37,850
Now's my chance.

81
00:07:57,220 --> 00:07:59,760
Trying to run? Did I allow you to move?

82
00:08:00,640 --> 00:08:02,720
You bullies!

83
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:04,120
Take this!

84
00:08:09,880 --> 00:08:11,360
I'll remember

85
00:08:11,960 --> 00:08:13,800
what you did to me today.

86
00:08:15,240 --> 00:08:16,120
Damn it.

87
00:08:16,960 --> 00:08:18,119
He got away.

88
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:19,279
Judicial Officer Ding Quan!

89
00:08:19,280 --> 00:08:20,719
Were you the one casting the Nuo arts?

90
00:08:20,720 --> 00:08:22,560
Have you found the thief Xu Ying?

91
00:08:22,660 --> 00:08:25,109
Ying, if we don't leave now,
it'll be too late.

92
00:08:25,110 --> 00:08:25,670
Let's go.

93
00:08:35,600 --> 00:08:36,449
Yuan Qi,

94
00:08:36,450 --> 00:08:37,250
thank you.

95
00:08:39,320 --> 00:08:40,600
You think I ran away?

96
00:08:41,320 --> 00:08:42,719
You avenged the villagers,

97
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:44,960
even risking your life to kill a deity.

98
00:08:45,160 --> 00:08:46,319
Among us demons,

99
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:48,000
loyalty is everything.

100
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:49,399
You showed honor and justice.

101
00:08:49,400 --> 00:08:51,719
I couldn't just abandon you
and run away alone.

102
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:52,599
I'm a human,

103
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:53,480
not a demon.

104
00:08:54,360 --> 00:08:55,479
Don't be so sure.

105
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:56,679
What if you're not?

106
00:08:56,680 --> 00:08:58,959
I've never heard of a human
mastering demonic techniques this quickly.

107
00:08:58,960 --> 00:09:01,469
Could this be why the Zhou family
wants to capture me alive?

108
00:09:01,470 --> 00:09:03,070
They don't think I'm

109
00:09:03,660 --> 00:09:04,860
half-demon, do they?

110
00:09:06,680 --> 00:09:07,480
No.

111
00:09:07,670 --> 00:09:09,000
I'm definitely a human.

112
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:10,400
I'm from Xujiaping.

113
00:09:10,610 --> 00:09:12,610
My parents are both from Xujiaping.

114
00:09:23,740 --> 00:09:24,629
Lord Wei Chu,

115
00:09:24,630 --> 00:09:25,589
he's still alive.

116
00:09:25,590 --> 00:09:27,909
Barely hanging on, by the life force
from the first level of Niwan Secret Art.

117
00:09:27,910 --> 00:09:29,510
[Warden
Wei Chu]

118
00:09:36,400 --> 00:09:38,559
Beaten to this state by a country bumpkin.

119
00:09:38,560 --> 00:09:40,909
What a disgrace
to the name of a Nuo Shaman.

120
00:09:40,910 --> 00:09:41,710
Yeah.

121
00:09:41,950 --> 00:09:43,199
Even if we save him,

122
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:44,669
he'll be good for nothing.

123
00:09:44,670 --> 00:09:46,099
Might as well leave him to die.

124
00:09:46,100 --> 00:09:48,030
Let's hurry and catch that Xu Ying.

125
00:09:48,200 --> 00:09:49,000
No.

126
00:09:49,720 --> 00:09:52,320
As fellow Nuo Shamans
serving the Zhou family,

127
00:09:52,800 --> 00:09:54,400
we should save him.

128
00:10:21,920 --> 00:10:24,519
Thank you for saving my life,
Lord Wei Chu.

129
00:10:24,520 --> 00:10:25,360
Ding,

130
00:10:25,920 --> 00:10:27,450
how did you end up like this?

131
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:29,599
That Xu Ying practices demonic techniques,

132
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:31,930
and a snake demon ambushed me from behind.

133
00:10:32,400 --> 00:10:34,060
That's why I'm in such a state.

134
00:10:36,320 --> 00:10:37,880
Rest easy, Ding.

135
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:39,920
As for capturing Xu Ying,

136
00:10:40,440 --> 00:10:42,040
leave it to me.

137
00:10:49,920 --> 00:10:50,720
Oh no.

138
00:11:02,400 --> 00:11:03,719
The fight was so fierce.

139
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:05,339
When did you snatch this

140
00:11:05,340 --> 00:11:06,540
from that Nuo Shaman?

141
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:08,860
When I dislocated his joints.

142
00:11:13,010 --> 00:11:14,540
As expected of an official.

143
00:11:15,400 --> 00:11:16,360
So rich.

144
00:11:19,280 --> 00:11:20,740
Cultivation techniques?

145
00:11:21,860 --> 00:11:24,599
Doesn't look like any
demon techniques I've seen.

146
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:27,079
Could this be
the Zhou family's secret arts?

147
00:11:27,080 --> 00:11:30,999
The Zhou family would never pass on
their orthodox arts to outer disciples.

148
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:33,689
Even this simplified Nuo technique
and manual aren't

149
00:11:33,690 --> 00:11:35,620
allowed out of the Zhou household.

150
00:11:35,760 --> 00:11:37,020
This handwritten copy

151
00:11:37,280 --> 00:11:40,880
must have been secretly copied
by Ding Quan from the Zhou family.

152
00:11:41,080 --> 00:11:41,880
Interesting.

153
00:11:43,320 --> 00:11:46,680
What Ding Quan practices
is probably the Niwan Secret Art.

154
00:11:47,930 --> 00:11:49,790
He cultivates it superficially,

155
00:11:49,920 --> 00:11:52,320
yet his strength is already so terrifying.

156
00:11:52,950 --> 00:11:55,910
The real Zhou family arts
must be far more powerful.

157
00:11:57,280 --> 00:12:01,119
But if I can break through to the
sixth level of Elephant Force Bull Fist,

158
00:12:01,120 --> 00:12:02,440
I won't fear Ding Quan.

159
00:12:03,700 --> 00:12:04,400
Yuan Qi,

160
00:12:05,330 --> 00:12:08,590
let me show you the essence
of the Elephant Force Bull Fist.

161
00:12:08,960 --> 00:12:09,599
You watch closely

162
00:12:09,600 --> 00:12:11,200
and refer to the scriptures.

163
00:12:14,160 --> 00:12:15,719
This is the
Great Sun Body-Refining Technique.

164
00:12:15,720 --> 00:12:16,920
It refines the body

165
00:12:17,110 --> 00:12:18,440
and purges impurities.

166
00:12:21,520 --> 00:12:22,520
That's not right.

167
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:24,380
You're doing it wrong.

168
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:25,960
Stop looking.

169
00:12:26,360 --> 00:12:28,199
This is the
Great Sun Body-Refining Technique.

170
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:29,759
I realized this during
my fight with Ding Quan—

171
00:12:29,760 --> 00:12:31,169
it's the missing one between
the Great Sun Guiding Technique

172
00:12:31,170 --> 00:12:33,030
and the Elephant Force Bull Fist.

173
00:12:33,520 --> 00:12:35,120
It wasn't hard to figure out.

174
00:12:36,700 --> 00:12:37,569
Wasn't hard?

175
00:12:37,570 --> 00:12:39,549
Three generations of my family
haven't figured it out,

176
00:12:39,550 --> 00:12:40,610
and you did so fast?

177
00:12:41,200 --> 00:12:42,120
You're lying.

178
00:12:52,270 --> 00:12:54,479
The sixth level
of the Elephant Force Bull Fist...

179
00:12:54,480 --> 00:12:55,280
is mastered.

180
00:12:58,150 --> 00:12:59,190
I give up.

181
00:12:59,280 --> 00:13:00,379
This guy's not human.

182
00:13:00,380 --> 00:13:01,140
Yuan,

183
00:13:01,990 --> 00:13:04,509
the key to practicing
the Elephant Force Bull Fist

184
00:13:04,510 --> 00:13:06,719
lies in qi and blood and body tempering.

185
00:13:06,720 --> 00:13:08,319
When your qi and blood are vigorous enough

186
00:13:08,320 --> 00:13:09,719
and strong enough,

187
00:13:09,720 --> 00:13:11,380
you can move to the next level.

188
00:13:12,240 --> 00:13:13,909
and comprehended
the Great Sun Body-Refining Technique.

189
00:13:13,910 --> 00:13:15,110
It's perfect for you.

190
00:13:19,350 --> 00:13:20,270
Let me try.

191
00:13:33,920 --> 00:13:34,680
It's

192
00:13:35,060 --> 00:13:35,820
coming

193
00:13:36,150 --> 00:13:36,830
from the...

194
00:13:38,230 --> 00:13:41,230
It's coming from
the direction of that broken temple.

195
00:13:42,900 --> 00:13:44,340
[Stone Mountain God
Huang Simping]

196
00:13:44,290 --> 00:13:45,970
Lord Stone Mountain God,

197
00:13:46,160 --> 00:13:48,320
could it be that thief Xu Ying?

198
00:13:50,880 --> 00:13:53,329
I heard Xu Ying just escaped from
God of Mount Hong today

199
00:13:53,330 --> 00:13:54,279
and went into hiding.

200
00:13:54,280 --> 00:13:56,280
I think it's very likely him.

201
00:13:57,260 --> 00:13:58,489
I also heard this afternoon

202
00:13:58,490 --> 00:14:01,119
that county officers
were sneaking around nearby.

203
00:14:01,120 --> 00:14:03,240
They must be looking for Xu Ying too.

204
00:14:07,360 --> 00:14:09,459
Congratulations, Lord Stone Mountain God.

205
00:14:09,460 --> 00:14:12,940
The credit for capturing Xu Ying
will definitely be yours.

206
00:14:16,050 --> 00:14:17,650
Yours.

207
00:14:18,310 --> 00:14:20,310
It's only a merit if we can catch him.

208
00:14:20,920 --> 00:14:21,480
Let's go

209
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:22,960
and take a look.

210
00:14:26,040 --> 00:14:26,840
I...

211
00:14:27,520 --> 00:14:30,479
I've cultivated the fifth level
of the Elephant Force Bull Fist.

212
00:14:30,480 --> 00:14:33,160
I've achieved divine elephant strength.

213
00:14:33,470 --> 00:14:37,550
Elephant god manifestation!

214
00:14:45,680 --> 00:14:47,109
Over the two or three hundred years,

215
00:14:47,110 --> 00:14:48,439
among three generations of my family,

216
00:14:48,440 --> 00:14:51,719
no snake has cultivated the fourth level
of the Elephant Force Bull Fist.

217
00:14:51,720 --> 00:14:53,339
I didn't expect

218
00:14:53,340 --> 00:14:55,440
now under your guidance,

219
00:14:55,560 --> 00:14:58,560
I've reached the fifth level in no time.

220
00:14:59,500 --> 00:15:02,199
It turns out cultivation is so easy,

221
00:15:02,200 --> 00:15:03,600
so simple.

222
00:15:05,720 --> 00:15:07,050
Congratulations, Niu.

223
00:15:07,720 --> 00:15:09,640
But your breakthrough just now

224
00:15:09,800 --> 00:15:11,909
caused a surge of qi and blood
that made an elephant's cry—

225
00:15:11,910 --> 00:15:13,579
it will surely
alert the nearby Phantom Deities

226
00:15:13,580 --> 00:15:15,180
and the officers chasing us.

227
00:15:15,720 --> 00:15:16,879
We need to leave now.

228
00:15:16,880 --> 00:15:17,760
Right.

229
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:20,199
If we get trapped in
this temple by pursuers,

230
00:15:20,200 --> 00:15:21,760
we're done for.

231
00:15:22,930 --> 00:15:23,990
What's that sound?

232
00:15:24,840 --> 00:15:25,640
Pursuers?

233
00:15:25,880 --> 00:15:27,810
So fast? And with such a commotion?

234
00:15:33,880 --> 00:15:35,210
It's the Phantom River.

235
00:15:35,440 --> 00:15:36,500
The Phantom River?

236
00:15:37,320 --> 00:15:39,520
There's no such river around Lingling.

237
00:15:41,360 --> 00:15:43,820
It's the Phantom River
of the Phantom Realm.

238
00:15:44,280 --> 00:15:47,569
The Phantom River has changed its course
and crossed into the mortal world.

239
00:15:47,570 --> 00:15:49,230
What are these green threads?

240
00:15:49,920 --> 00:15:50,920
They're ghosts.

241
00:15:51,060 --> 00:15:52,779
So many ghosts are out.

242
00:15:52,780 --> 00:15:54,900
The mortal world is going to suffer.

243
00:16:31,030 --> 00:16:32,990
If his plan is successful,

244
00:16:31,300 --> 00:16:36,490
[Next Episode]

245
00:16:33,320 --> 00:16:35,780
Then the Qi cultivators will rise again.

246
00:16:36,710 --> 00:16:38,830
A few insignificant mortals deaths

247
00:16:39,450 --> 00:16:40,940
are not worth mentioning.

248
00:16:41,850 --> 00:16:43,080
I didn't expect

249
00:16:43,670 --> 00:16:45,520
the first person I saw

250
00:16:45,900 --> 00:16:48,100
when I woke up after 3,000 years was you.

251
00:16:49,220 --> 00:16:50,670
What monster is this?

252
00:16:54,670 --> 00:16:55,930
I'll tear you apart

253
00:16:56,720 --> 00:16:59,740
and tear off your bones one by one!

